            "review_title": "Review at Dlai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Amy H\nManchester, United Kingdom31 contributions\n0\nGorgeous place, lucky find\nApr 2018 • Solo\nI set off from my hotel to find a different restaurant but came across this place. It looked so nice from outside I thought it was worth a shot. \n\nI'm so glad I did. I got the warmest welcome which is reassuring for a solo traveller and was seated in a nice spot. The staff are so friendly.\n\nFood was some of the best I had on my trip, highly recommend the turmeric fish and garlic garden herbs/vegetables. \n\nReally nice place to sit and chill out. There was no rushing and I had an enjoyable time. Thank you!\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2018",
